„რა ღია დავალებები გვაქვს?" was answered „50 open" of her 74: the in-app tool
lists the newest 50 goals and gave no total. It now answers the same
{ tasks, total } the connector already does (getMyTasksPage), the count taken
with the list's own exclusion.

